# D3-AD-005: Clear water can still contain dissolved salt
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 methyl_orange 0.005g
add v1 NaCl 0.005mol
add v1 activated_charcoal 0.10g
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 NaCl 0.005mol
filter v1 v3
measure v2 conductivity
measure v3 conductivity
measure v3 uvvis
particles v3
inspect
